  - id: dead-signature/0
    title: Dead Signature / Unsent message
    company:
    contract: Dead Signature
    text: 'ORIN / Directorate defector: Reconstruct a signing chain attributed to an administrator who died years ago. The sender asks you to keep the names attached to the evidence; anonymous totals have concealed people before.'
  - id: dead-signature/1
    title: Dead Signature / Custody note
    company:
    contract: Dead Signature
    text: "Archive custody, Dead Signature: MOTH\u2019s relay holds fragments of that administrator\u2019s authorization. A second copy carries a hand-written objection to the official disposition."
