    title: Dead Signature / Private annotation
    company:
    contract: Dead Signature
    text: "Personal note filed under dead-signature: MOTH\u2019s relay holds fragments of that administrator\u2019s authorization. Someone has crossed out the word inevitable. No replacement was supplied."
